{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.poster.avif?t=1756960261\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.webm?t=1756960261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.mp4?t=1756960261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate what matters. Cut away the rest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prune is a love letter to trees\u2013a puzzle game about cultivating growth and the joy of letting go. Grow and shape your tree into the sunlight while avoiding the dangers of a hostile world. Bring life to a forgotten landscape and uncover a story hidden deep beneath the soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant simplicity - click and drag to plant your tree. Then, as it quickly grows before your eyes, prune away unwanted branches. Bloom enough flowers to complete each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditation - an antidote to today's overstimulated, always-on world. Take a deep breath, stay awhile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeless story - explore the evolving dance between civilization and nature, seen through the quiet eyes of trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respects your time - a focused 1\u20132 hour experience designed to stay with you long after it ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now on PC - experience every branch, bloom, and abstract landscape in full-screen detail, where every level is a piece of art. Enjoy the rich soundscape, featuring a beautifully orchestrated score by Kyle Preston.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper roots \u2013 finished the main story? Uncover additional challenges, for those who seek more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.poster.avif?t=1756960261\" width=960 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.webm?t=1756960261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.mp4?t=1756960261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903490?t=1756960261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903490?t=1756960261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/86112d89d5679d436337e1c1888d6ce09d4a8007/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756960261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/86112d89d5679d436337e1c1888d6ce09d4a8007/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756960261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.poster.avif?t=1756960261\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=